{"actor":"operator","id":"basicly-isc0ko7#ev-0306a5c432","kind":"field","payload":{"name":"description","provenance":"engine","value":"## Trigger\n\nWhen a tracker-only source-checkout push reruns the unchanged code suite, I want equivalent native-push inputs to reuse trusted results, so I can avoid the demonstrated 109-second repeat.\n\n## Steps to Reproduce\n\nThe v0.26.6 source/tag push established passing evidence, then the final tracker-only main push reran pytest while all three compiler checks reused. See the final-push evidence and correction on basicly-h79lott.5. Compare direct and actual native hook inputs by component hash, establish the cause, and verify a real metadata-only native push.\n\n## Scope\n\n- `src/basicly/pytest_inputs.py`\n- `src/basicly/verify.py`\n- `src/basicly/verify_cache.py`\n- `src/basicly/verify_artifact.py`\n- `tests/test_pytest_inputs.py`\n- `tests/test_verify_pytest.py`\n- `docs/how-to/wire-up-the-verify-gate.md`\n- `changelog.d/**`\n\n- `basicly.toml`\n\n- `basicly.d/basicly-bms86yx.toml`\n\n- `pyproject.toml`\n\n- `tests/test_kit_packages.py`\n\n- `tests/test_kit_consumer_install.py`\n\n- `tests/test_kit_consumer_journey.py`\n\n- `tests/test_kit_bundle.py`\n\n- `tests/test_hatch_build.py`\n\n## Publication repair\n\nThe actual native tag gate exposed 24 packaging failures and 5 fixture errors: uv refreshed an unbounded build backend through the removed proxy. Keep every packaging case fresh with inherited transport; explicitly disable uv network access in the cached independent suite. The unpublished candidate is withheld.\n"},"record":"basicly-isc0ko7","seq":31,"totals":{"attempts":2,"events":31,"spend_micros":0,"status":"open"},"ts":"2026-10-19T13:47:34.937185Z"}
